==Description==
'''Nerd Duck Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[Ducky Revenge Event]] as a reward for reaching Level 6 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|150}} or {{Robux|42}} ({{Robux|35}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|520}} or {{Robux|324}} ({{Robux|271}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Nerd Duck Charm''' appearance is based on the [[Nerd Duck (Story)|Nerd Duck]]. It has the [[Nerd Duck (Story)|Nerd Duck]] standing next to a panel. It plays a sound of a totem falling down with a duck quack in the background.

The color changes based on the player's username color, but appears orange in inventory preview.

==Update History==
*'''16 April 2025''' - [[v1.61.0]]
