**{{Bug}} '''Nerd Duck Charm''' shakes uncontrollably and can collide with players.
*'''23 April 2025''' - [[v1.62.0]]
**{{Bugfix}} '''Nerd Duck Charm''' can no longer be collided with.
*'''11 June 2025''' - [[v1.66.0|v1.66.1a]]
**'''Nerd Duck Charm''' is no longer obtainable.



